!!MarkDown Libraries

Client-side Markdown conversion used by the WYSIWYG Markdown editor (/OpenForum/Editor/Editors/WYSIWYGMarkDownEditor). They are unmodified copies from npm (jsDelivr), all MIT licensed.

|File|Package|Global|Use|
|markdown-it.min.js|markdown-it 14.1.0|markdownit|Markdown to HTML|
|turndown.js|turndown 7.2.0|TurndownService|HTML to Markdown|
|turndown-plugin-gfm.js|turndown-plugin-gfm 1.0.2|turndownPluginGfm|GitHub-style tables, strikethrough and task lists for turndown|
|markdown-view.js|(OpenForum, OFS-R-002)|MarkdownView|Read-only formatted previews of Markdown with a Formatted / Markdown switch, http(s) addresses as links opening in a new tab, and linkifyElement for existing HTML. Raw HTML is shown as text. Include only this file; it loads markdown-it from this folder.|

License texts: LICENSE-markdown-it.txt, LICENSE-turndown.txt and LICENSE-turndown-plugin-gfm.txt.
